        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Pete the Penguin woke up and found himself in a mysterious and dangerous world. But his mission continues— to collect as many flowers as he can. Help him navigate this challenging world by avoiding obstacles like shooting projectiles, spawning rain clouds and more while gaining points by collecting flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small arcade game in which you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move clockwise or counterclockwise around a disgruntled planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect flowers to boost your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hazards like lightning strikes, projectiles, and the ever-persistent Shadow Pete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to beat your high score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive in Pete’s World?</p>",
